OL,3,GNEWSAAnti-migrant protesters gather as
OL,4,Asmall boat heads for south coast
OL,5,
OL,6,FProtesters have gathered in a south
OL,7,Fcoast town as a small boat believed to
OL,8,Fbe carrying more than 100 migrants
OL,9,Fheads for the shore.
OL,11,FThe dinghy appeared to have set off
OL,12,Ffrom near the Utah Beach area of
OL,13,FNormandy on Sunday morning, according
OL,14,Fto ship tracking data. It was being
OL,15,Fshadowed by French rescue vessels but
OL,16,Fnow appears to be in waters off
OL,17,FGosport, Hampshire, with RNLI boats on
OL,18,Fthe scene.
OL,20,FFrench media reported there were about
OL,21,F120 migrants on board.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
