OL,3,GNEWSAAnti-migrant protesters gather as
OL,4,Asmall boat heads for south coast
OL,5,
OL,6,FHampshire Police said it had deployed
OL,7,Fofficers to Gosport to "support our
OL,8,Fpartners in the event of an emergency
OL,9,Fat sea". The force has imposed
OL,10,Fconditions under the Public Order Act
OL,11,Fas well as powers prohibiting the
OL,12,Fwearing of face coverings.
